  "unitName": "4. Vulnerability Analysis",
  "unitDescription": "This unit teaches vulnerability analysis through a controlled assessment of Northbridge Civic Services. Players identify common misconfigurations, verify findings, evaluate risk and feasibility, compare assessment types, and reason about exploitation pathways while staying inside an authorized security engagement.",
  "defaultPlayerName": "Alex",
  "unitEntryMessage": "Welcome back, {player}. Northbridge Civic Services has authorized a controlled vulnerability assessment before an external audit. Mara Voss, the client-side security program manager, will guide the opening phase. Your job is to verify evidence, understand risk, and keep the assessment useful without crossing the line into unauthorized exploitation.",
